#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Appointment</font></strong>: Allow "
"prospects to book a free tour, shared desk, or meeting room online."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ການນັດໝາຍ</font></strong>: "
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ສົນໃຈຈອງເຂົ້າຊົມຟຣີ, ຈອງໂຕະແບ່ງປັນ, ຫຼື ຫ້ອງປະຊຸມແບບອອນລາຍ."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">CRM &amp; Membership</font>: </"
"strong>Track and manage coworking opportunities, follow-up, and convert them "
"into active members."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">CRM &amp; ສະມາຊິກ</font>: </"
"strong>ຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ຈັດການໂອກາດ Coworking, ຕິດຕາມຜົນ, ແລະ ປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເປັນສະມາຊິກທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Email Marketing</font></strong>: "
"Share news, updates, and promotions with your members."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານອີເມວ</font></strong>: "
"ແບ່ງປັນຂ່າວສານ, ການອັບເດດ, ແລະ ໂປຣໂມຊັນຕ່າງໆ ໃຫ້ກັບສະມາຊິກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Events</font>: </strong>Organize "
"networking sessions, workshops, and community-building activities."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ກິດຈະກຳ</font>: </"
"strong>ຈັດກອງປະຊຸມສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ເວີກຊັອບ, ແລະ ກິດຈະກຳສ້າງຊຸມຊົນ."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Helpdesk</font>: </strong>Handle "
"member requests and issues efficiently."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ລະບົບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ</font>: </"
"strong>ຈັດການຄຳຮ້ອງ ແລະ ບັນຫາຕ່າງໆ ຂອງສະມາຊິກຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Planning</font>: </strong>Schedule "
"reception desk coverage and other staff shifts."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ການວາງແຜນ</font>: </"
"strong>ຈັດຕາຕະລາງປະຈຳການໂຕະຕ້ອນຮັບ ແລະ ກະການເຮັດວຽກຂອງພະນັກງານອື່ນໆ."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Sales</font>: </strong>Generate and "
