#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Daylight is a top-floor coworking space in the heart of Brussels, just a "
"<strong>short walk from Central Station</strong>, designed around natural "
"light and the rhythm of a working day.&amp;nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"Daylight ແມ່ນພື້ນທີ່ Coworking ຊັ້ນເທິງສຸດ ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃຈກາງນະຄອນບຣຸກແຊນ, ພຽງແຕ່ "
"<strong>ຍ່າງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດກ້າວຈາກສະຖານີລົດໄຟກາງ</strong>, ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຮັບແສງທຳມະຊາດ ແລະ "
"ຈັງຫວະຂອງມື້ເຮັດວຽກ.&amp;nbsp;"

