msgstr "ກຳນົດການເຂົ້າຊົມແລ້ວ"

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Track and schedule repairs for equipment like printers, or coffee machines "
"with <strong>Maintenance</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ຈັດຕາຕະລາງສ້ອມແປງອຸປະກອນ ເຊັ່ນ: ຈັກພິມ, ຫຼື ຈັກຕົ້ມກາເຟ ດ້ວຍ "
"<strong>ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ</strong>."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:event.event,description:coworking.website_event_event_1
msgid "Tuesday 25 August 2026, 16:00–16:45"
msgstr "ວັນອັງຄານ 25 ສິງຫາ 2026, 16:00–16:45"

