#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Use <strong>Auto-Plan</strong> to assign shifts based on availability."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ <strong>ວາງແຜນອັດຕະໂນມັດ</strong> ເພື່ອມອບໝາຍກະເຮັດວຽກຕາມຄວາມພ້ອມ."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use <strong>Rental</strong> to support a \"Private office\" offer in your "
"coworking."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <strong>ການເຊົ່າ</strong> ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີ \"ຫ້ອງການສ່ວນຕົວ\" ໃນ Coworking ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
