msgid "• Spacious desks • Unlimited coffee • Fast &amp;amp; Reliable Wi-Fi"
msgstr "• ໂຕະກວ້າງຂວາງ • ກາເຟແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ • Wi-Fi ໄວ &amp;amp; ໝັ້ນຄົງ"

